<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Invoice - {{invoiceNumber}}</title>
</head>

<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; margin: 0; padding: 20px;">
  <div
    style="max-width: 800px; margin: auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); overflow: hidden;">
    <div style="padding: 20px; box-sizing: border-box;">
      <h2 style="margin-top: 0; color: #333;">Invoice - {{invoiceNumber}}</h2>
      <p>Dear Parent,</p>

      <p>Greetings from Jazzrockers! </p>

      <p>We hope you and your family are doing well.</p>

      <p>This is a kind reminder that the invoice for your child’s monthly course fee has been
        generated and is now available on the Student Management Portal. You may log in to
        review or download the invoice at your convenience.</p>

      <p>We kindly request you to complete the payment on or before the 10th of this month to
        avoid any late fees or service interruptions.</p>

      <p>Should you have any questions or require assistance with the portal, please feel free to
        reach out to +971 800 509 or contact@jazzrockers.com.</p>

      <p>Thank you for your continued support and cooperation.</p>

      <p>Warm Regards,<br /><br />Jazzrockers</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>

</html>